or PLC in Orange County","/arc-plc/new-york/orange-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids runs 75 years, and August to September and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 53% of normal in January to February and 162% in May to June. So far in 2026, June to July came in at 125% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 25423 had its driest year in 1965, at 66% of normal.</p>"}
